        {
          "id": 752442398,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is it required?\nBecause this bug is caused by the new routine introduced by Zoran to create the dissector directly from the github source https://github.com/zoranbosnjak/asterix-specs using the template and by using tools/asterix/update-specs.py. \n\nThe bug is present in the tools/update-specs.py which is generating the dissector. I have informed Zoran about the same.\n\nEdit:\nThis merge request is not good as it breaks all other DEC decoding.",
